<TITLE>Color LCD Panel</TITLE>
<LIST1><ITEM><PTXT>The display uses a TFT (Thin Film Transistor) type LCD panel with a 7-inch wide screen with an aspect ratio of 9:16 (height 91.44 x width 152.40mm). The liquid crystal cells are subdivided into pixels of 234 vertical x 1200 horizontal; each liquid crystal cell (pixel) corresponding to each color filter is controlled in an analog manner from fully closed to fully open by the RGB video signals, so that colors are mixed additively and all colors can be expressed.</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1>
